					"content": "供奉棲木的事情，就拜託啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						722250202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿瑠"
				},
				{
					"id": 722250202,
					"content": "我在這裡陪著阿久哥。",
